{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15345","headline":"秋日旅舍别司空文明 · 李端","name":"秋日旅舍别司空文明","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉风飒穷巷，秋思满高云。\n吏隐俱不就，此心仍别君。\n素怀宗淡泊，羁旅念功勳。\n转忆西林寺，江声月下闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}